<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> The SCP itself is a Crown that, when worn by a sentient being, will brainwash other sentient beings into worshipping whomever wears the Crown if the being wills it. The being that is wearing the Crown is an Intelligent Turkish Angora Cat, and said Cat has taken over Site-33, turning it into his 'Palace'.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> Narrative will mostly revolve around how the Cat acquired the Crown, during a Site-Wide Containment Breach, and the aftermath. To explore on how the Crown has affected Site Personal, there will be MTF Logs, showing their mission to retake Site-33, and to recapture the anomalies.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The Hook will be the initial SCP File, which is Site-33's version of the file edited by a Brainwashed Researcher, telling us how we should worship the Cat, and make offerings and/or sacrifices for it. After that, there will be the actual file from outside Site-33, describing the anomaly and how to contain it, along with the MTF Logs.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong>I would like any advice on how the Foundation can counter the Brainwashing affect of the Crown, and if there is a specific terminology I can use. I know I probably need to expand on the Crown and how it really works. Also, if there is specific breed of Cat that you think would be more fitting, please tell me.</p>

